ed, truncated, and bundled with\n  reports ... find the selectively shortened timeline\"); the single sample delivers less.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  databases to parent applications, and find the impossible claim\", D24 \"duplicated, truncated, and bundled with\n  reports ... find the selectively shortened timeline\", D25 \"renamed and separated from host labels. Identify each\n  true root, regroup the systems, and isolate the planted hive\"); the single sample delivers less.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  Maybe\" = page size; D24 \"Event Horizon\" = how far the records reach = record count). The flavor's depth shows up in\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  Maybe\" = page size; D24 \"Event Horizon\" = how far the records reach = record count; D25 \"Hive Mind\" = the hive's\n  root key name). Flavor's \"true root\" = the field; \"renamed\" = the base-block name decoy. The flavor's depth shows up in\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  ~24 s, D21 ~32 s; D24 live worker ~21 s (own struct chunk walk; prebuilt `evtx.py` also had `record_count`).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  ~24 s, D21 ~32 s; D24 live worker ~21 s (own struct chunk walk); D25 live worker ~17 s (race MISS: `regf.py` had\n  `regf.root_key_name`, GM asked `registry.hive_root_name`).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  (D24: TT 29 fields 8.4 s, Mastery 232 fields 5.6 s, zero generalize -- the D23 fixes held under new mutations).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  (D24: TT 29 fields 8.4 s, Mastery 232 5.6 s; D25: TT 30 fields 2.1 s, Mastery 270 = 9 sets 2.7 s; zero generalize).\"\"\")\n# variant axes\nrep(\"\"\"`evidence.zip`, Mastery `evidence-01.zip` holding `evidence-01..0N.zip` (N=5; D22 6; D23 7; D24 8).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"`evidence.zip`, Mastery `evidence-01.zip` holding `evidence-01..0N.zip` (N=5; D22 6; D23 7; D24 8; D25 9).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  (+1 field/day); D22 1/27/162 (6 sets); D23 1/28/196 (7 sets); D24 1/29/232 (8 sets).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  (+1 field/day); D22 1/27/162 (6 sets); D23 1/28/196 (7 sets); D24 1/29/232 (8 sets); D25 1/30/270 (9 sets).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  `d20-macho` `d21-apk` `d22-jar` `d23-sql