re relative to 0x1000 (first hbin); every cell starts with an i32 size, so `nk` sits at 0x1000+off+4.\n- SQLite: page size `1` = 65536\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"python-evtx `Evtx` + `evtx_dump.py` (.venv);\"\"\",\"\"\"python-evtx `Evtx` + `evtx_dump.py`, regipy (.venv);\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nPYEOF\n.venv/bin/python -I $TMPDIR/d25tl/edit_tech.py && wc -l reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md","description":"Apply day25 edits to technique log"}}}
